---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Dun - Author Profile"
  description="Personal profile, journey from computer science to video editing and graphic design, tools, and creative interests."
  section="about"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <!-- Header Badge -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest bg-sumeru-100 dark:bg-nahida-mint/10 text-sumeru-800 dark:text-nahida-mint border border-sumeru-300/40 dark:border-nahida-mint/20">
        <span data-i18n="about-badge">AUTHOR PROFILE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Personal Intro Card -->
    <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-sumeru-200/60 dark:border-white/[0.08] mb-12 space-y-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-8 pb-8 border-b border-sumeru-200/40 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
        <div class="relative w-36 h-36 sm:w-44 sm:h-44 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-sumeru-300/60 dark:border-nahida-mint/30 shadow-xl shrink-0">
          <img
            src="/images/about-me-image.jpg"
            alt="Ha Manh Dung (Dun)"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            onerror="this.src='/images/Nahida_Icon.webp'"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="text-center sm:text-left space-y-2">
          <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-sumeru-950 dark:text-white" data-i18n="about-name">
            Ha Manh Dung
          </h1>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-sumeru-600 dark:text-nahida-mint tracking-wider uppercase" data-i18n="about-role-sub">
            KNOWN AS DUN / EUPHORIA · VIDEO EDITOR / GRAPHIC DESIGNER
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-sumeru-800/85 dark:text-nahida-light/80 leading-relaxed pt-2 italic" data-i18n="about-quote">
            “My personality can be quite moody. Sometimes I’m talkative and full of energy, while at other times I become rather quiet and withdrawn. Honestly, I’m still figuring myself out. But working on and creating things, as well as observing everything around me, always brings me a great deal of joy.”
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story Narrative -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-sumeru-800/85 dark:text-nahida-light/80 leading-relaxed">
        <!-- Welcome to my personal blog! -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-sumeru-950 dark:text-white" data-i18n="about-welcome-title">
            Welcome to my personal blog!
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p1">
            Nahida is feeling sleepy right now, so I’ll be here to fill in for her for a little while.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p2">
            My full name is <strong>Ha Manh Dung</strong>. I go by <strong>Dun</strong> or <strong>Euphoria</strong>.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p3">
            I’ve just completed the first semester of my third year, majoring in Computer Science at <strong>VNU University of Science - Vietnam National University, Hanoi</strong>. However, I decided to leave university, and I’m currently working as a <strong>video editor</strong>.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p4">
            My personality can be quite moody. Sometimes I’m talkative and full of energy, while at other times I’m rather quiet and reserved. To be honest, even I’m not entirely sure what kind of person I am.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p5">
            I’m quite passionate about game development, but for a few reasons, I wasn’t able to focus on my studies from the beginning. As a result, I’m not particularly good at coding, despite it being the major I was studying. I’m also quite busy managing a small YouTube and TikTok channel, as well as a small shop on Shopee - hmm... you could say I really enjoy spending time in front of a computer screen.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p6">
            During my time at university, I gradually developed a passion for something else - <strong>graphics</strong>. I eventually realized that while I was still passionate about game development, I didn’t actually have a strong passion for coding itself. So I decided to pursue game development from a graphical perspective rather than focusing on the code behind it.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p7">
            And so, while I continued studying at university (though I’m not even sure whether I can really call it studying anymore), I began exploring and learning <strong>After Effects</strong> and <strong>Blender</strong> - software specialized in post-production effects, as well as 3D modeling and environment creation.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p8">
            Then, about four months ago, once I became confident that my skills could help me find work, I sat down with my family and decided to leave university and begin my journey into professional work.
          </p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-sumeru-900 dark:text-nahida-mint" data-i18n="about-welcome-p9">
            At the moment, I work as a semi-professional video editor and graphic designer.
          </p>
          <p data-i18n="about-welcome-p10">
            However, I have no intention of giving up on my unfinished academic path. I plan to work for about two years to invest in equipment and save enough for tuition, before studying and retaking exams for a different university.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- WORKSPACE -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-6 border-t border-sumeru-200/40 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-sumeru-950 dark:text-white" data-i18n="about-ws-title">
            WORKSPACE
          </h2>
          <p data-i18n="about-ws-desc">
            Currently, I mainly work with the following tools:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4 list-disc marker:text-sumeru-500 dark:marker:text-nahida-mint">
            <li data-i18n="about-ws-capcut">
              <strong>CapCut PC</strong>: A suitable tool for short-form videos that don’t require many complex effects (though, to be honest, I really hate CapCut).
            </li>
            <li data-i18n="about-ws-ae">
              <strong>Adobe After Effects</strong>: My favorite editing software and also the first one I learned. I mainly use it for complex post-production effects, especially motion graphics - an area where CapCut cannot do particularly well.
            </li>
            <li data-i18n="about-ws-ps">
              <strong>Adobe Photoshop</strong>: An image-editing and GFX design software that I really love. Although I started learning it quite late and my skill level is still fairly beginner, it remains my preferred choice over other software.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- INTERESTS -->
        <div class="space-y-5 pt-6 border-t border-sumeru-200/40 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-sumeru-950 dark:text-white" data-i18n="about-interests-title">
            INTERESTS
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-sumeru-900 dark:text-nahida-mint mb-1 flex items-center gap-2" data-i18n="about-interest-game-title">
                <span>Gaming</span> 🎮
              </h3>
              <p data-i18n="about-interest-game-desc">
                The games I currently play most often are <strong>Genshin Impact, Arena of Valor</strong>, and <strong>Honor of Kings</strong>. I especially love Genshin - my girlfriend is in there &lt;3
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-sumeru-900 dark:text-nahida-mint mb-1 flex items-center gap-2" data-i18n="about-interest-media-title">
                <span>Watching Videos / Movies</span> 📺
              </h3>
              <p data-i18n="about-interest-media-p1">
                I really enjoy watching esports tournaments (even for games I don’t play myself), such as <strong>Arena of Valor Premier League, AOV International Championship, Honor of Kings Pro League, PUBG Global Series, ...</strong>
              </p>
              <p class="mt-2" data-i18n="about-interest-media-p2">
                As for movies, I enjoy adventure and rom-com anime, as well as science-fiction films.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-sumeru-900 dark:text-nahida-mint mb-1 flex items-center gap-2" data-i18n="about-interest-music-title">
                <span>Music</span> 🎶
              </h3>
              <p data-i18n="about-interest-music-desc">
                Instrumental Music and EDM
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Facts / Tags -->
      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-sumeru-200/40 dark:border-white/[0.06] grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center">
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-sumeru-50/80 dark:bg-sumeru-950/50 border border-sumeru-200/50 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-sumeru-600 dark:text-nahida-mint mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider" data-i18n="about-fact-loc-label">LOCATION</div>
          <div class="font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-sumeru-950 dark:text-white" data-i18n="about-fact-loc-val">Thanh Hoa, Vietnam</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-sumeru-50/80 dark:bg-sumeru-950/50 border border-sumeru-200/50 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-sumeru-600 dark:text-nahida-mint mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider" data-i18n="about-fact-work-label">MAIN CREATIVE WORK</div>
          <div class="font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-sumeru-950 dark:text-white" data-i18n="about-fact-work-val">Video Editing & 3D</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
